00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.970
Christmas...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.370
Lost Child

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.500
I'm always right here.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.380
Who is it?

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.550
The same dream?

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:49.190
To think I'm still having this dream...

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.810
when you're already...

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.750
N-No!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.670
No! No!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.670
Christmas!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.220
Christmas...

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.480
Christmas...

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.160
I'm home!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:44.450
Oh, Kurau, you're awake?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:49.120
I went shopping. I'll make you a hot egg soup.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.420
There wasn't a store nearby,
so I went a little farther.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.840
And I found a store that sells all kinds of things!

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.510
Why did you go so far away?!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:08.560
But, Kurau... you had a high fever.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.600
Fever?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.100
Sweat?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.020
Why?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.740
You seemed to be so uncomfortable.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:26.530
I thought I should give you
something to eat. That's why...

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:31.700
But it's a very dangerous time now.
So please don't go out alone.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.000
Please...

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.050
I'll make it right away. Hold on.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.140
Christ... mas...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.690
Kurau!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.150
Kurau! Kurau!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.780
Kurau!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:11.410
I worry about you. Please... stay here.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.790
Kurau...

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.160
I'm all right...

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.710
If I rest for a while, I'll be better soon.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.800
Kurau!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.000
It's open! Come in.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.880
Sorry you had to come in.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:06.720
Our policy is to not accept phone requests.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.970
Man, it's so noisy!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.560
Can't we have some peace and quiet?!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.560
Oh, don't mind me.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:20.060
Some fool seems to be going wild with a pod.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.270
This place is so dangerous, I tell you...

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.740
And so, how can I help you?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.080
Now, everyone!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.750
Here's a new kind of apple, just arrived today.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.130
It's three times sweeter and more nutritious
than the existing kinds.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.960
Eat one a day and you'll be so healthy
you won't need a doctor.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.130
Oh, is it delicious!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.090
I can feel myself getting healthier!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.730
She's gone?

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:07.320
What a pity...

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.070
She disappeared after one night.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.910
Oh, man...

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.050
Who is it?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:36.010
Oh, you're up? Are you all right?
Sam was worried about you.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:40.850
Actually, somebody was just here looking for you.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.560
Of course, I told him I didn't know anything,

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.570
but I thought you should be careful.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.490
I see... Thanks.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.200
Good-bye.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.170
I'm hungry...

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.220
Christmas...

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.720
Christmas!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.110
Christmas... Why?

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.070
Where have you gone?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.440
But, Kurau... you had a high fever.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.570
You seemed to be so uncomfortable.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.870
That's why...

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.250
Christmas...

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.290
Michi, you're so slow.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.460
Wait a sec-

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.260
Ouch!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.050
You're so clumsy, Michi.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.390
Let's go.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:05.390
Let's go.
Let's go.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.910
Christmas...

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.080
Christmas!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.290
Mama!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.420
Welcome home!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.090
Now, what are you so excited about?

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:35.470
Well, it's my birthday today. Papa's waiting.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.760
All right... Don't pull me so hard.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.350
Where are you, Christmas?

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.620
Chief, Craft 501 here...

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.030
The target is still moving in the same direction.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.500
It will arrive at the projected point in twenty seconds.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.290
All crafts, this is the chief...

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.620
We will use the anti-blue unit rays.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.000
Release safety switch!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.800
Turn on your rays!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.850
The target has entered sleep mode.

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:26.100
Okay! Prepare interceptor rays!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.280
So, she hasn't registered with
any of the other Brokers...

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.570
Oh, man...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.120
W-What's going on?!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:54.960
That girl!

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.310
K-Kurau!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.390
Kurau!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.520
Kurau! Kurau!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.480
KURAU!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:14.860
Christmas!

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.420
It's following me!

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.630
This blue unit is glowing gold?!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.140
Did I get it?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:01.900
Th-That was close!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.890
Kurau...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:35.900
Kurau... Kurau... Kurau...

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.310
KURAU!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.780
Kurau!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.990
That pod from yesterday...
it's you piloting it, isn't it, Go?

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.000
Go... Are you talking about this body?

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.840
Why? Rynax!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:11.350
You are the one who called me to this world.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:17.520
I came to this world through you.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.780
Where? Where is my Pair?

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.660
My Pair.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:59.150
Please pardon the inconvenience.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:04.280
The accident in Area 26
is being cleaned up by the GPO.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.780
Please be patient a little longer.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.670
I'm sorry...

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.170
Thank goodness...

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.130
Huh?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.430
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.930
Kurau...

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.440
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.190
You sure did, Christmas.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:46.400
When you get home, I'll expect you
to fix something delicious.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.780
Okay!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.910
Oh, yeah! Look at this!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:56.290
I'll use this, and this time, I'll make...

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.080
What's the matter?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:05.130
They got cracked again!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.720
Come on, don't look like that.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.550
I feel full of energy thanks to your thoughtfulness.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:18.890
Give me an apple.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.520
Huh? Oh, okay...

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.530
Oh! it's delicious!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.730
Really?

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:35.450
Christmas, wait here for a little while.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.120
That Rynax?

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:40.660
Mm-hmm...

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.830
What are you going to do?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.790
I don't know... what to do.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.920
But I've got to do something.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.050
Is your body all right?

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.550
Yeah.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.220
I'm perfectly fine.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.680
I'll be right back, so wait here.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:01.730
Okay...

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.190
Kurau...

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:32.510
What? What should I do?

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.840
Anyway, I've got to take it somewhere where it won't be seen.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.640
Is it near?

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.610
Stop!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.240
Please... remain calm.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.660
Where is my Pair?

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.920
It isn't anywhere.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:08.090
Where are you?

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.630
Where are you?

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.340
Where are you?

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.980
Where are you?

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.230
You are...

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:46.500
I can't do anything for you.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:52.210
I don't know how to remove
the loneliness within you.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.510
I don't know...

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.400
it's outfitted for suppression!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.190
Wait!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.450
NO!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.660
You're in pain, aren't you?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:08.750
What should I do?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.260
Wh-What?!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.520
What was that?

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.070
I see...

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:45.080
You've returned to your previous world...

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:07.680
Kurau!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:24.740
The Rynax returned to its
previous world through me.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:31.540
Go returned to his former human self.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.380
If I did the same thing,
I could return this body to Dad...

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:40.420
If you return your body,
what will happen to you, Kurau?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.970
If I return this body...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.760
If I return this body...
what will happen to Christmas?

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:59.820
Dr. Amami... I am grateful that
you are working under me.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:04.990
The technology I will be showing you is something
I have developed based upon your research.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.580
It was put into use three months ago.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:13.580
Hmph! It seems they've been giving
the GPO a lot of trouble.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.290
They?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.680
What is this?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.550
Attractor Rynax System...

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:35.350
It is a weapon for capturing wandering Rynax.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:46.860
From a great distance

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:46.860
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:56.210
You smile at me

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:56.210
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.340
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.340
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:14.430
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:14.430
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:23.690
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:23.690
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:32.780
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:32.780
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:41.920
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:41.920
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.050
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.050
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.260 --> 00:23:00.230
Moonlight

00:22:53.260 --> 00:23:00.230
Moonlight

